    "answer": {
      "short": "$804$, $814$, $824$, $834$ or $844$; the missing digit can be 0 to 4.",
      "worked": "The first significant figure is 8, in the hundreds place. To round down to 800, the tens digit must be less than 5.\nThe possible original numbers are $804$, $814$, $824$, $834$ and $844$.",
